: "Cut a video by marking its transcript, entirely on the phone"}, "description": {"en-US": "Open a video or a sound recording: the app writes down what is said, and you mark on\nthe text, as with a highlighter, the passages to keep or to cut. Listen to the edit,\nthen produce it as a video or a sound file, with soft joins and, if you like, a square\npicture. Cutting by whole sentences is the most precise; within a sentence a cut can\nfall a little off. The transcription runs on the phone, slowly but without an account\nor a network: the only download is the transcription model, once, when you ask.\n"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/com.freedomfighter.readersvideoeditor/en-US/icon_Y8QvExDN6Yb66NsDrkoNiHqZlFncuag8caQH_XfWkzo=.png", "sha256": "63c42f1310cde986fae8db03ae4a0d887a999459dcb9a83c71a407fd77d6933a", "size": 1246}}, "preferredSigner": "b9c722e093f963ab7812922623e1c1a72fb9998537ad7d9aefa8b1a3f3a8120c"}, "versions": {"fdafadc2cb7fc6d8a8930db295e18574109db0e6780467d9da28749d47274ce4": {"added": 1794651156000, "file": {"name": "/ReadersVideoEditor-v0.1.4.apk", "sha256": "fdafadc2cb7fc6d8a8930db295e18574109db0e6780467d9da28749d47274ce4", "size": 31228576}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "x86_64"], "versionName": "0.1.4", "versionCode": 5, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 29, "targetSdkVersion": 36}, "signer": {"sha256": ["b9c722e093f963ab7812922623e1c1a72fb9998537ad7d9aefa8b1a3f3a8120c"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_DATA_SYNC"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_MEDIA_PROCESSING"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.WAKE_LOCK"}, {"name": "com.freedomfighter.readersvideoeditor.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION"}]}}}}}}